Taken from FreeBSD main, not yet in stable/15 (MFC pending):
  ftp.c     ftp_pwd() and ftp_cwd(), 243ac45 (D61502, "Fix buffer overruns in
            FTP code", reported by us).  Same text as main.  Drop this note
